`finish()` already serializes against ordinary writes by taking the journal writer, but `clear()` releases journal ordering only after it has called the tree clear. The race looks like `Ingestion::new()` can prepare state while `clear()` mutates version state, so I’m checking whether a keyspace-local operation mutex is available or should be added.
